#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:13
msgid "Rebuilds the stored markdown copy of a page or post every time you save it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:14
msgid "AI bots always read the current text, not an old copy. Saving a post takes a moment longer."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:15
msgid "Turn it off only if you prefer to regenerate the copies on a schedule below."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:18
msgid "Content types that never get a markdown copy and never appear in llms.txt or the AI sitemap."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:19
msgid "AI bots cannot read these pages through the markdown address. The pages stay on the normal site as before."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:20
msgid "Hiding a type here does not hide it from search engines or from the normal page. Use it to keep technical or private types out of the AI overview."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:23
msgid "Taxonomies are the ways you group content, such as categories and tags. The terms of the groups you tick are listed in [[llms.txt]] and in the AI sitemap."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:24
msgid "AI assistants get a table of contents of your site: which topics exist and where to find them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:25
msgid "Untick groups that are only for internal use or have hundreds of terms nobody needs to see."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:28
msgid "The heading at the top of your [[llms.txt]] file, which is the first thing an AI assistant reads about your site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:29
msgid "AI answers use this name when they talk about you. Empty means the site title of WordPress."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:30
msgid "Fill it in when the site title is long or is not the name people know you by."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:33
msgid "A short description of the site, shown under the heading of [[llms.txt]]."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:34
msgid "Helps AI assistants understand in one or two sentences what you do and who you serve. Empty means the tagline of WordPress."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:35
msgid "Write it in plain words and keep it factual. Advertising slogans tell the AI very little."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:38
msgid "Publishes the file /llms.txt in the root of your site. [[llms.txt]] is a plain text overview that tells AI assistants what the site is about and which pages matter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:39
msgid "AI crawlers and assistants can find your key content faster and describe it better. The file is generated for you, you do not edit it by hand."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:40
msgid "The file is public. Everything listed in it can be read by anybody, so keep private content in the excluded types."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:41
msgid "Turn it off if you do not want to guide AI assistants, or if another plugin already serves /llms.txt."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:44
msgid "Publishes /ai-sitemap.md, a list of all published items with their date and a link to their markdown version."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:45
msgid "AI bots can find and revisit all your content without crawling the whole site page by page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:46
msgid "On a very large site the list is long. It is cached, so it does not slow the site down."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:47
msgid "Turn it off when you do not want a full list of your content to be easy to fetch."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:50
msgid "Adds ?format=markdown to the address of any post or page to return it as clean markdown, without menus, scripts and layout."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:51
msgid "AI bots read your content with fewer tokens and fewer mistakes than from the full page. The normal page does not change."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:52
msgid "Turn it off if you do not want AI bots to be able to fetch the text of your pages in this form."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:55
msgid "Starts every markdown copy with a short header block of facts (title, address, type, date, author) written in [[YAML]], a simple text format for structured data."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:56
msgid "AI tools can read the facts about the page without guessing them from the text."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:57
msgid "Turn it off when the consumer of the markdown expects pure text with no header."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:60
msgid "How long a generated markdown copy is kept before it is built again on the next visit of a bot."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:61
msgid "A longer time saves server work. A shorter time keeps copies fresh when content changes outside normal saves, for example through prices or imports."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:62
msgid "Unlimited is fine for most sites, because saving a post always rebuilds its copy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:65
msgid "Rebuilds the markdown copies of the whole site on a schedule, using [[WP-Cron]], the WordPress scheduler."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:66
msgid "Catches changes that did not go through a normal save, such as bulk imports. The rebuild uses some server time while it runs."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:67
msgid "WP-Cron runs only when somebody opens a page, so on a site with very little traffic the run can come late."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:68
msgid "Leave it off when you rely on saving posts."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:71
msgid "The numbers (IDs) of single posts or pages that never get a markdown copy. Separate them with commas, for example 12, 45, 78."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:72
msgid "Hides individual pages from the AI overview and the markdown address. You find the ID in the address bar when you edit the page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:75
msgid "Records each visit of a known AI bot (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot and others) on the markdown addresses. Normal visitors are not logged."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:76
msgid "You see which AI services read your site and which pages they ask for. The log grows with the traffic of the bots."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:77
msgid "The log stores the bot name and the address visited. It is cleaned automatically by the retention below."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:78
msgid "Turn it off if you do not need the statistics."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:81
msgid "How many days the entries of the bot access log are kept. Older entries are deleted once a day."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:82
msgid "Keeps the log small. With 0 nothing is deleted and the table grows without end."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:83
msgid "Use 0 only when you export the log yourself."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:86
msgid "Uses a richer markdown template for products, with price, stock and attributes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:87
msgid "AI assistants can answer questions such as \"is it in stock\" or \"what does it cost\" from the markdown copy of a product."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:88
msgid "Turn it off if you do not want prices and stock to be readable by AI bots."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:91
msgid "Adds the price of the product to the [[YAML]] header of its markdown copy."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:92
msgid "AI assistants can quote the current price. A copy that is not rebuilt for a long time can show an old price."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:93
msgid "Turn it off when prices differ by customer or should not be public."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/AiMarkdown/help.php:96
msgid "Adds the currency code (CZK, EUR and so on) next to the price."
