#: includes/Modules/SmtpEmail/help.php:77
msgid "Together with the ID it identifies this site to Google."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Modules/SmtpEmail/help.php:78
msgid "Anyone with the secret can pose as this site toward Google. Replace it in Google Cloud if it leaks."
msgstr ""

